  "error_model": "classical OLS: se(beta) = sqrt(ss_res/(n-2) / sum((x-xbar)^2)); two-sided 95% band = beta +/- t(0.975, n-2) * se.  The periods are overlapping 20-bar windows 20 bars apart, so they do not overlap at all -- that is the one thing this error model is entitled to assume.",
